[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a>\n                                           (left\nonly)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a></p><p>1. Remove the embellishment.</p><p>2. Undo and remove the relay mechanism.</p><p>3. Unscrew the winder retaining bolt.</p><p>4. Remove the seat belt.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035876.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seat belt is\nundamaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If the seat belt has been subjected\nto great stress, e.g. following an accident, it must be replaced\nas a complete unit together with its anchorages and the retaining\nbolts. Even if the seat belt does not show signs of visible defects,\nit may have lost its strength properties.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Fit the winder.</p><p>2. Tighten the winder retaining bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT REEL..</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>40</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Tighten the bolt securing the seat belt relay mechanism.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT IDLER..</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>40</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Fit the embellishment.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035877.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2892183\">7040B18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892192\">7040G40</a>\n                                           (left\nonly)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892201\">7040H42</a></p>"]]